#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePikeLobby/scripts.inc:274
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePikeLobby_Text_WelcomeToBattlePike"
msgid ""
"Where the luck of TRAINERS\n"
"is put to the test…\p"
"Welcome to the BATTLE PIKE…\p"
"I am your guide to the BATTLE PIKE…$"
msgstr ""
"考验训练家运气的地方……\p"
"欢迎来到对战管道……\p"
"我是对战管道的向导……$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePikeLobby/scripts.inc:280
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePikeLobby_Text_TakeChallenge"
msgid ""
"Would you like to take the Battle\n"
"Choice challenge?$"
msgstr "你要挑战对战抉择吗？$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePikeLobby/scripts.inc:284
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePikeLobby_Text_ExplainBattlePike"
msgid ""
"Here we conduct an event we call\n"
"the Battle Choice.\p"
"The Battle Choice rules are very\n"
"simple…\p"
"Choose one of three paths and make\n"
"your way to the goal room at the end\l"
"of the BATTLE PIKE. It's that simple.\p"
"However, what happens on the chosen\n"
"path depends entirely on the luck\l"
"of the challenger…\p"
"If you reach the goal, you will be\n"
"rewarded with Battle Points.\p"
"If you want to interrupt your\n"
"challenge, please have a word with\l"
"our staff in the big rooms on the way.\p"
"If you don't save before interrupting,\n"
"you will be disqualified.$"
msgstr ""
"这里举办的是\n"
"名为对战抉择的比赛。\p"
"对战抉择的规则\n"
"非常简单……\p"
"从3条路中选择1条，\n"
"前往对战管道尽头的终点房间。\l"
"就是这么简单。\p"
"不过，在选择的路上会发生什么，\n"
"完全取决于挑战者的运气……\p"
"如果到达终点，\n"
"就能获得对战点数作为奖励。\p"
"如果想中断挑战，\n"
"请和途中大房间里的\l"
"工作人员说一声。\p"
"如果中断前没有记录，\n"
"就会被取消资格。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePikeLobby/scripts.inc:303
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePikeLobby_Text_LookForwardToSeeingYou"
msgid ""
"We look forward to seeing you\n"
"on another occasion…$"
msgstr "期待下次再见到你……$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePikeLobby/scripts.inc:307
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePikeLobby_Text_WhichChallengeMode"
msgid ""
"You have the choice of two courses,\n"
"Level 50 and Open Level.\l"
"Which will you challenge?$"
msgstr ""
"你可以从两种赛制中选择：\n"
"Lv.50和自由等级。\l"
"你要挑战哪一种？$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePikeLobby/scripts.inc:312
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePikeLobby_Text_NotEnoughValidMonsLv50"
msgid ""
"I beg your pardon, but…\p"
"You do not have three eligible\n"
"POKéMON for the Battle Choice event.\p"
"You must have three different POKéMON\n"
"of Level 50 or less to enter.\p"
"They also must be holding different\n"
"kinds of items.\p"
"EGGS{STR_VAR_1}.$"
msgstr ""
"非常抱歉……\p"
"你没有3只能参加\n"
"对战抉择的宝可梦。\p"
"必须带上3只等级在50以下的\n"
"不同宝可梦才能参加。\p"
"而且，它们携带的道具\n"
"也必须各不相同。\p"
"蛋{STR_VAR_1}。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePikeLobby/scripts.inc:322
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePikeLobby_Text_NotEnoughValidMonsEnd"
msgid ""
"Please come see me when\n"
"you are ready…$"
msgstr ""
"准备好以后\n"
"请再来找我……$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePikeLobby/scripts.inc:326
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePikeLobby_Text_NotEnoughValidMonsLvOpen"
msgid ""
"I beg your pardon, but…\p"
"You do not have three eligible\n"
"POKéMON for the Battle Choice event.\p"
"You must have three different\n"
"POKéMON to enter.\p"
"They also must be holding different\n"
"kinds of items.\p"
"EGGS{STR_VAR_1}.$"
msgstr ""
"非常抱歉……\p"
"你没有3只能参加\n"
"对战抉择的宝可梦。\p"
"必须带上3只\n"
"不同的宝可梦才能参加。\p"
"而且，它们携带的道具\n"
"也必须各不相同。\p"
"蛋{STR_VAR_1}。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePikeLobby/scripts.inc:336
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePikeLobby_Text_PleaseChooseThreeMons"
msgid ""
"Please choose the three POKéMON\n"
"you wish to enter in the challenge…$"
msgstr ""
"请选择要参加挑战的\n"
"3只宝可梦……$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePikeLobby/scripts.inc:340
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePikeLobby_Text_SaveBeforeChallenge"
msgid ""
"Before starting your Battle Choice\n"
"challenge, I must save the game.\l"
"Is that acceptable?$"
msgstr ""
"开始对战抉择的挑战之前，\n"
"我必须先记录游戏进度。\l"
"可以吗？$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePikeLobby/scripts.inc:345
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePikeLobby_Text_StepThisWay"
msgid "Please step this way…$"
msgstr "请往这边走……$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePikeLobby/scripts.inc:348
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePikeLobby_Text_ChallengeEndedRecordResults"
msgid ""
"Your challenge has ended…\p"
"I shall record your results.\n"
"Please wait…$"
msgstr ""
"你的挑战结束了……\p"
"我会记录你的成绩。\n"
"请稍候……$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePikeLobby/scripts.inc:353
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePikeLobby_Text_PossessLuckInAbundance"
msgid ""
"You have completed the challenge…\p"
"I must say… You seem to possess luck\n"
"in abundance…$"
msgstr ""
"你完成了挑战……\p"
"我不得不说……\n"
"你的运气似乎非常好……$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePikeLobby/scripts.inc:358
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePikeLobby_Text_ShallRecordResults"
msgid ""
"I shall record your results.\n"
"Please wait…$"
msgstr ""
"我会记录你的成绩。\n"
"请稍候……$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePikeLobby/scripts.inc:363
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePikeLobby_Text_AwardYouTheseBattlePoints2"
msgid ""
"To commemorate your completion of\n"
"the Battle Choice challenge, we award\l"
"you these Battle Point(s)…$"
msgstr ""
"为了纪念你完成对战抉择的挑战，\n"
"我们将这些对战点数\l"
"送给你……$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePikeLobby/scripts.inc:369
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePikeLobby_Text_ReachedBattlePointLimit"
msgid ""
"You appear to have reached the limit\n"
"for Battle Points…\p"
"Please exchange some Battle Points\n"
"for prizes, then return…$"
msgstr ""
"你的对战点数\n"
"似乎已经达到上限了……\p"
"请用一些对战点数\n"
"兑换奖品后再来……$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePikeLobby/scripts.inc:375
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePikeLobby_Text_FailedToSaveBeforeQuitting"
msgid ""
"I beg your pardon, but…\p"
"You failed to save before you quit\n"
"your challenge the last time.\p"
"Because of that, your challenge so far\n"
"has been disqualified. I am sorry…$"
msgstr ""
"非常抱歉……\p"
"你上次中断挑战之前\n"
"没有记录。\p"
"因此，你之前的挑战\n"
"已经被取消资格了。抱歉……$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePikeLobby/scripts.inc:382
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePikeLobby_Text_SnatchedVictoryFromQueen"
msgid ""
"Congratulations…\p"
"You have snatched victory from the\n"
"PIKE QUEEN and cleared the event…$"
msgstr ""
"恭喜你……\p"
"你从管道女王手中夺得胜利，\n"
"完成了比赛……$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePikeLobby/scripts.inc:387
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePikeLobby_Text_AwardYouTheseBattlePoints"
msgid ""
"In recognition of your amazing luck,\n"
"we award you these Battle Point(s)…$"
msgstr ""
"为了表彰你惊人的运气，\n"
"我们将这些对战点数送给你……$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePikeLobby/scripts.inc:391
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePikeLobby_Text_OneRoomAwayFromGoal"
msgid ""
"Arrgh! I blew my chance!\n"
"I was one room away from the goal!\p"
"In this place, you'd better watch out\n"
"for poison, freezing, and so on.$"
msgstr ""
"啊啊！我错失良机了！\n"
"明明离终点只差一个房间！\p"
"在这里，最好小心\n"
"中毒、冰冻之类的状态。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePikeLobby/scripts.inc:397
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePikeLobby_Text_NeverHadToBattleTrainer"
msgid ""
"I've completed the challenge 10 times\n"
"now, but I've never had to battle\l"
"a TRAINER once.$"
msgstr ""
"我已经完成10次挑战了，\n"
"可是一次都没和训练家对战过。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePikeLobby/scripts.inc:402
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePikeLobby_Text_ThinkAbilitiesUsefulHere"
msgid ""
"Listen! Listen!\p"
"Don't you think that the special\n"
"abilities of POKéMON will be useful\l"
"here?$"
msgstr ""
"听我说！听我说！\p"
"你不觉得宝可梦的特性\n"
"在这里会很有用吗？$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePikeLobby/scripts.inc:409
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePikeLobby_Text_TrainersWhicheverPathIChoose"
msgid ""
"What is this weird place?\n"
"I can't figure it out at all!\p"
"I've taken the challenge a bunch\n"
"of times, but all I ever do is run into\l"
"TRAINERS whichever path I choose.$"
msgstr ""
"这是什么奇怪的地方啊？\n"
"我完全搞不懂！\p"
"我挑战了好多次了，\n"
"可是不管选哪条路，\l"
"遇到的都是训练家。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePikeLobby/scripts.inc:416
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePikeLobby_Text_RulesAreListed"
msgid "The Battle Choice's rules are listed.$"
msgstr "上面列着对战抉择的规则。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePikeLobby/scripts.inc:419
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePikeLobby_Text_ReadWhichHeading"
msgid "Which heading do you want to read?$"
msgstr "你要阅读哪一项？$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePikeLobby/scripts.inc:422
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePikeLobby_Text_ExplainPokenavBagRules"
msgid ""
"The BAG and POKéNAV may not be used\n"
"during a Battle Choice challenge.$"
msgstr ""
"挑战对战抉择期间，\n"
"不能使用背包和宝可导航。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePikeLobby/scripts.inc:426
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePikeLobby_Text_ExplainHeldItemRules"
msgid ""
"During a Battle Choice challenge,\n"
"any BERRY or HERB held by POKéMON\l"
"will be effective only once.$"
msgstr ""
"挑战对战抉择期间，\n"
"宝可梦携带的树果或香草\l"
"只会生效一次。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePikeLobby/scripts.inc:431
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePikeLobby_Text_ExplainMonOrderRules"
msgid ""
"During a Battle Choice challenge,\n"
"the sequence of POKéMON cannot be\l"
"changed.\p"
"The sequence must be set before\n"
"starting your challenge.$"
msgstr ""
"挑战对战抉择期间，\n"
"不能改变宝可梦的顺序。\p"
"必须在开始挑战之前\n"
"排好顺序。$"
